Package: cinminai-llama-cuda
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: cinminai-llama (= @VERSION@), libcudart12, libcublas12, libcublaslt12
Description: llama.cpp CUDA module for the Cin-MinAI assistant (NVIDIA)
 Runs the assistant's model on an NVIDIA graphics card with the proprietary
 driver (GTX 9xx and newer; built with CUDA 12.0 for Pascal, Turing, Ampere and
 Ada, and PTX for Maxwell and newer cards). Without the NVIDIA driver it is
 simply not used. The CUDA libraries come from Ubuntu (multiverse).
